{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40758","headline":"雪 · 李洞","name":"雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢来极塞，连阙谓风吹。\n禅客呵金锡，征人擘冻旗。\n细填虫穴满，重压鹤巢欹。\n有影晴飘野，无声夜落池。\n正繁秦甸暖，渐厚楚宫饥。\n冻挹分泉涩，光凝二阁痴。\n踏遗兰署迹，听起石门思。\n用表丰年瑞，无令埽玉墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}